     "text": "- Live-music concert \u201cCastle Rat: Summon The Beasts Tour 2026\u201d in Atlanta on Saturday, Sept. 26, 2026 at 6:30 PM at The Masquerade \u2013 Heaven\n- Headliner Castle Rat is an American doom metal band formed in Brooklyn, New York, in 2019, described as \u201cmedieval fantasy doom metal\u201d blending traditional doom and heavy metal with theatrical live performances\n- Show format includes theatrical performances with elaborate costumes, choreographed battle scenes, and on-stage character \u201cThe Rat Reaperess\u201d, with the band led by vocalist/rhythm guitarist Riley Pinkerton (\u201cThe Rat Queen\u201d) and known for debut album *Into the Realm* (2024)\n- Tour support is listed as goth rockers Unto Others and cinematic dungeon synth entity Wraith Knight, on a North American run beginning Sept. 23 in Baltimore and concluding Oct. 21 in New York\n- Venue is a mid-sized concert venue located in Kenny\u2019s Alley, the lowest level of Underground Atlanta\n- Listed address is 50 Lower Alabama St SW, Atlanta, Georgia, in Underground Atlanta\n- Heaven capacity is listed as 1,450, compared with 650 (Hell), 300 (Purgatory) and 250 (Altar)\n- Venue programming is mostly alternative styles such as indie rock, metal, punk rock, rockabilly and electronic, ranging from local to internationally known acts",
